<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    Google Play Games Services – achievement IDs.

    These IDs are generated by the Google Play Console when you create each achievement.
    Replace every REPLACE_WITH_GPGS_ACHIEVEMENT_ID placeholder with the real value
    from https://play.google.com/console → your app → Play Games Services → Achievements.

    The resource name convention is:
        achievement_<Achievement.getId().toLowerCase()>

    This file is read at runtime by AndroidAchievementService, which performs a resource
    lookup using the achievement's ID string, so the names here MUST match the pattern above.
-->
